Drop all your comestibles and then pick them up again - unidentified
food rations don't stack until you do this due to the spoilage factor.
Other than that use a chest(s) place somewhere you'll be back and forth
to, say the level above the first level of the mines or at the bottom of
sokoban. You will find that a chest beside the stairway up every 5
levels helps a *lot* in encumberance and reducing deaths due to being
burdened. An  a uncursed sack of some kind - preferably *not* holding
unless you know the caveats on it to carry around with you with what you
*need* to survive *now* - i.e. *no* spellbooks. Put most potions,
scrolls, eggs and wands in it along with *all* your money you are
carrying. 


